menu "e32p: i2c"

    config E32P_I2C_ENABLE
        bool "Enable e32p_i2c (I2C master facade)"
        default n
        help
            Bus + device facade over the ESP-IDF v5.x i2c_master driver: create a
            bus, probe / scan for devices, attach devices, and do byte / register
            transfers. Requires the new driver (not the legacy driver/i2c.h).

endmenu
